AArch64 LB+data-stxp-arr
"STXP of a value read from x, on two array elements (a true data dependency): herd reads the data register with read_reg_ord and allows LB, which needs the stored value before the load that produces it; Kraken's Promising machine certifies promises without value speculation and forbids it (open issue)"
{
uint64_t t[2];
uint64_t x;
0:X5=t; 0:X1=x; 1:X5=t; 1:X1=x;
uint64_t 0:X0; uint64_t 1:X2;
}
P0                   | P1               ;
LDR X0,[X1]          | LDR X2,[X5]      ;
LDXP X6,X7,[X5]      | DMB SY           ;
STXP W8,X0,X0,[X5]   | MOV X4,#1        ;
                     | STR X4,[X1]      ;
exists (0:X0=1 /\ 1:X2=1)
